    "player_hint_count": "7",
    "player_hint_1_en": "(G) is in the Warehouse beside a crate, and (C) is in the Vault. There's only one square beside a statue in the Warehouse and in the Vault, so (D) can't be in the Warehouse or in the Vault, as (G) and (C) wouldn't also be able to be beside a statue. This sets (D) in the Exhibition Hall.",
    "player_hint_2_en": "(H) can't be in C9, as (B) needs to be one column east of (H).  So (A), (D) and (H) are the three people in the Exhibition Hall, and they must all be beside a statue, per (D)'s clue. No one else can be in that area, per (A)'s clue.",
    "player_hint_3_en": "In order to place exactly three people in the Exhibition Hall, (A), (D) and (H) must be in R1, R2 and R3 in some order. Block R4 in the Exhibition Hall. This isolates (H) in the only square beside a statue remaining, R1 C3.",
    "player_hint_4_en": "This isolates (B) in the Air Duct in R9 C4, then (C) in the last square inside the Vault, then (G) in the last square beside a crate.",
    "player_hint_5_en": "(A) and (D) are in R2 or R3 in some order. Whoever is in R3 must be beside the statue, in R3 C7. Block the rest of C7. This isolates (E) in R4 C8.",
    "player_hint_6_en": "(F) needs to be exactly one column west of (A). (F) and (A) can't be in C6 and C7 or they would block (D) completely. This sets (F) in R6 C5, which isolates (A) and (D).",
    "player_hint_7_en": "This isolates (V) in R7 C9, alone with (B) in the Air Duct. Bruce is the murderer!"
